---
/**
 * A margin note. Authored inline in MDX at the point it annotates:
 *
 *   Some claim in the text.<Sidenote>The qualification to it.</Sidenote>
 *
 * Renders two spans — the in-text marker and the note body — numbered by two
 * CSS counters that stay in step because the pair is always emitted together.
 * All positioning lives in EssayLayout; this component only marks up.
 *
 * Only meaningful inside the editorial register. A note has no margin column,
 * so a sidenote in one would render inline with nowhere to go.
 */
---

<span class="sidenote-ref" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="sidenote"
  ><slot /></span
>
